# Conformance base for task-group failure (D-48): one task of a group fails, the
# group's other tasks are cancelled, and `join` delivers the first error.

groupFailure is project
groupFailure purpose "Show a task group delivering its first failure and stopping its other tasks"
groupFailure target console
groupFailure version "0.1.0"
groupFailure language refined 1
groupFailure standardLibrary 1
groupFailure allows write console.stdout none
groupFailure allows read clock.monotonic none
groupFailure requires none
groupFailure includesModule groups
groupFailure entry groups.main
